/** We have already set extendedStatus (ITS) in previous script to be stopped. 
 * This code block will change ITS to 'Transfer to CATI' = 21. 
 * This has the effect of triggering the CATI scheduler, which will run its
 * own script, and update the ITS to be 'Timed out or Stopped' = 54
 * This is all happening while the respondent is stil doing the survey.
 * And every time the respondent enters the start block. 
 * Within this and the previous script, we have updated ITS 3 times!
 * Suggestion from Danny: Let's not call it timed out or stopped, since this
 * isn't something that exists on Forsta. Perhaps, 'Started survey' would be 
 * more intelligeable. 
 */
